,000. No outside groups are active in the race, and no expert raters have flagged it as competitive.\n\nThe only available poll, conducted in late July by a Democratic-leaning firm, showed Fry ahead 41 to 37 among likely voters, closer than the district's baseline but still a Republican lead. Prediction markets give Vincent roughly a 6 percent chance. The race is rated Likely Republican, with Fry favored by a comfortable but not insurmountable margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0379, "margin": -13.69}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0396, "margin": -14.0}]}